WEBVTT

01:34.920 --> 01:37.680
ADAPTED FROM DEMON KING
OF JINJIANG LITERATURE CITY

01:37.760 --> 01:40.800
ORIGINAL WORK BY JIULU FEIXIANG

01:52.760 --> 01:54.680
My lord is in
a very dangerous situation now.

01:55.320 --> 01:57.280
His primordial spirit is trapped
in a dream.

01:57.360 --> 01:58.440
A dream?

01:58.520 --> 01:59.560
Yes.

01:59.640 --> 02:00.800
This dream was constructed

02:00.880 --> 02:03.000
with my lord's entire primordial spirit.

02:03.480 --> 02:05.080
And to maintain this dream,

02:05.160 --> 02:06.920
my lord is burning his internal fire,

02:07.000 --> 02:08.360
depleting his primordial spirit.

02:09.000 --> 02:10.600
If he continues like this, I fear…

02:12.000 --> 02:12.960
What do you fear?

02:14.320 --> 02:16.640
I fear that
my lord's primordial spirit will shatter

02:17.280 --> 02:18.360
and he will be obliterated.

02:18.440 --> 02:20.080
Then do something!

02:20.160 --> 02:21.120
That won't happen!

02:24.640 --> 02:26.240
Moon Supreme is immortal.

02:26.840 --> 02:28.600
How could a mere dream trap him?

02:31.480 --> 02:33.840
What if my lord doesn't want to wake up?

02:34.680 --> 02:35.800
What do you mean?

02:46.480 --> 02:47.640
Moon Supreme.

02:47.720 --> 02:48.600
This is bad.

02:48.680 --> 02:50.520
My lord's primordial spirit
is burning even faster!

02:56.720 --> 02:58.280
Shangque, you…

02:58.360 --> 03:00.280
I'm giving him
my primordial spirit's power.

03:00.360 --> 03:01.920
Maybe it can buy us some time.

03:02.400 --> 03:03.480
General, you mustn't.

03:03.560 --> 03:05.760
You will die too
if the spiritual power rebounds.

03:05.840 --> 03:07.520
My lord gave me my life.

03:08.880 --> 03:10.480
Now I am returning it to him.

03:18.280 --> 03:19.160
I'll help too.

04:14.280 --> 04:15.480
Master.

04:15.960 --> 04:17.079
What's wrong?

04:19.440 --> 04:20.360
Hao,

04:20.440 --> 04:21.959
your sword intent is becoming flawed.

04:22.920 --> 04:24.000
In the past,

04:24.080 --> 04:25.200
your sword intent

04:25.280 --> 04:26.920
always had a mortal heart.

04:27.800 --> 04:29.480
But why does it have a killing intent now?

04:31.720 --> 04:33.720
Ever since you were seriously injured,

04:34.240 --> 04:36.360
I've been filled with resentment
toward the Moon Tribe.

04:37.080 --> 04:38.880
I want to destroy the Cangyan Sea.

04:39.840 --> 04:41.680
Maybe that is why my sword intent

04:41.760 --> 04:43.160
has a killing intent now.

04:43.800 --> 04:46.000
Hao, I told you before.

04:46.080 --> 04:47.160
As a warrior,

04:47.240 --> 04:48.480
no matter what you experience

04:48.560 --> 04:49.920
or lose,

04:50.000 --> 04:51.920
you must not be blinded by hatred.

04:52.000 --> 04:55.080
Otherwise, the fighting will never end.

04:56.640 --> 04:57.760
I know.

05:09.240 --> 05:10.360
Lord Changheng.

05:13.280 --> 05:14.200
Right now,

05:15.320 --> 05:17.120
Lord Yunzhong is taking the immortals

05:18.080 --> 05:20.480
to the memorial tablet
to mourn the goddess.

05:20.560 --> 05:21.920
Aren't you going?

05:23.800 --> 05:26.320
The fate you saw in the Tianji Mirror
hasn't come true yet.

05:26.400 --> 05:28.480
Orchid will come back to life.

05:29.080 --> 05:30.000
But…

05:30.520 --> 05:32.360
- My lord.
- Danyin.

05:34.520 --> 05:35.720
Thank you

05:36.320 --> 05:38.040
for telling me everything that you saw

05:38.120 --> 05:39.320
in the Tianji Mirror.

05:39.400 --> 05:40.720
But Orchid

05:41.480 --> 05:42.600
will come back to life.

05:43.600 --> 05:46.000
I will scour the three realms if I must.

05:46.080 --> 05:47.680
No matter the cost,

05:48.480 --> 05:50.120
I will bring her back.

06:10.080 --> 06:11.840
Why are all the Destiny Books

06:11.920 --> 06:13.120
about lovers

06:13.200 --> 06:15.680
that are separated,
never to see each other again?

06:16.880 --> 06:18.600
Look, this one is the same too.

06:20.520 --> 06:21.520
This one too.

06:26.960 --> 06:28.000
Yes.

06:29.040 --> 06:30.240
Fortunately,

06:31.160 --> 06:33.840
the two of us will stay together

06:33.920 --> 06:36.120
and never be apart.

06:40.400 --> 06:42.080
We will never be apart.

06:43.120 --> 06:44.240
Big Blockhead.

06:45.440 --> 06:46.720
Promise me

06:47.200 --> 06:49.600
that you will never leave me, all right?

06:53.560 --> 06:54.520
I promise you.

06:55.240 --> 06:56.560
I will never leave you.

07:09.920 --> 07:11.280
Lord Xunfeng. General.

07:11.360 --> 07:13.280
His internal fire is blazing stronger.

07:13.360 --> 07:15.000
Retract your power

07:15.080 --> 07:16.160
or you will die!

07:19.800 --> 07:20.760
General!

07:20.840 --> 07:21.920
Lord Xunfeng!

07:22.680 --> 07:24.840
General! Lord Xunfeng! Retract your power!

07:29.240 --> 07:30.080
Changheng?

07:34.480 --> 07:36.040
The two tribes have come to a ceasefire.

07:36.120 --> 07:37.960
How dare you come to harm my brother?

07:38.520 --> 07:40.120
Do you think so little of the Moon Tribe?

07:40.200 --> 07:41.440
I'm here to save him.

07:42.040 --> 07:42.920
You?

07:43.480 --> 07:44.320
You're from the Fairy Tribe.

07:44.400 --> 07:46.280
- Lord Xunfeng.
- Dongfang Qingcang is dying.

07:46.360 --> 07:47.800
I don't need to harm him myself.

07:48.400 --> 07:50.000
If you stop me and waste time,

07:50.080 --> 07:51.360
he is bound to die.

07:51.920 --> 07:52.760
Lord Xunfeng.

07:54.000 --> 07:55.840
Saving my lord is more important.

08:05.760 --> 08:07.760
I will enter his dream and wake him up.

08:07.840 --> 08:09.800
If he doesn't wake up

08:10.360 --> 08:11.440
before the incense burns out,

08:12.640 --> 08:14.080
then he is beyond saving.

09:32.880 --> 09:33.880
Changheng?

09:35.160 --> 09:36.000
You…

09:36.080 --> 09:37.400
What did you see?

09:40.240 --> 09:41.280
It's none of your business.

09:41.920 --> 09:43.120
Get out of here.

09:44.560 --> 09:45.640
Tell me.

09:45.720 --> 09:47.240
What did you see in the Tianji Mirror?

09:47.800 --> 09:49.080
I asked you to leave.

09:49.160 --> 09:50.000
Otherwise…

09:50.080 --> 09:52.160
Dongfang Qingcang,
how long will you lie to yourself?

09:53.480 --> 09:55.120
All of this is fake.

09:55.200 --> 09:56.160
It's all a dream!

09:57.040 --> 09:58.000
Nonsense.

09:59.760 --> 10:01.240
Have you really not noticed?

10:01.800 --> 10:02.960
This is just a dream.

10:03.040 --> 10:05.320
You don't want to accept
that Orchid is dead,

10:05.400 --> 10:06.680
so you're escaping from reality

10:06.760 --> 10:08.360
and hiding in your dream like a coward.

10:08.440 --> 10:09.320
Shut up!

10:09.400 --> 10:10.640
She can still come back to life!

10:24.920 --> 10:26.480
Didn't you see it in the Tianji Mirror?

10:26.960 --> 10:28.360
It is a prophecy.

10:29.600 --> 10:31.280
The prophecy hasn't come true yet.

10:31.880 --> 10:32.720
She won't die.

10:33.640 --> 10:34.760
She will come back to life.

10:38.040 --> 10:39.240
Dongfang Qingcang,

10:39.960 --> 10:41.200
I need your help.

10:41.960 --> 10:43.160
Only if you help me

10:43.640 --> 10:44.720
can we save her.

10:46.960 --> 10:48.160
Come out with me.

10:48.880 --> 10:50.280
As long as you leave Arbiter Hall,

10:50.360 --> 10:51.440
you will wake up.

10:56.080 --> 10:58.000
Big Blockhead, where are you going?

11:05.480 --> 11:06.480
See?

11:08.280 --> 11:09.760
Orchid is still alive.

11:11.160 --> 11:12.960
She is my wife now.

11:13.920 --> 11:15.560
Dongfang Qingcang, she is not Orchid.

11:16.360 --> 11:18.040
The real Orchid is dead.

11:18.760 --> 11:20.040
But as long as you leave with me,

11:20.800 --> 11:21.800
we can save her.

11:23.720 --> 11:25.720
Don't listen to him. I'm not dead.

11:25.800 --> 11:27.520
I'm right here.

11:28.080 --> 11:29.400
Dongfang Qingcang, wake up.

11:29.480 --> 11:31.040
She is not Orchid.

11:31.120 --> 11:33.080
She is just your obsession deluding you.

11:34.080 --> 11:35.760
If you continue to stay in this dream,

11:35.840 --> 11:37.840
you will die
from a depleted primordial spirit.

11:37.920 --> 11:38.840
Big Blockhead,

11:38.920 --> 11:40.880
we've been married for 500 years.

11:40.960 --> 11:41.920
Never for a single day

11:42.000 --> 11:43.480
have we been apart.

11:43.560 --> 11:45.040
Do you also suspect me?

11:53.000 --> 11:54.240
The incense has burned up.

11:56.880 --> 11:58.280
All we can do now

11:59.360 --> 12:00.640
is wait.

12:11.360 --> 12:12.200
Leave!

12:17.240 --> 12:18.200
He refuses to wake up.

12:34.600 --> 12:35.760
Don't go.

12:36.760 --> 12:38.400
Please. Don't leave.

12:38.480 --> 12:39.640
Don't go anywhere.

12:42.880 --> 12:44.160
Didn't you promise me

12:44.240 --> 12:46.040
that you would never leave me?

12:52.920 --> 12:54.120
I promised you

12:55.920 --> 12:57.640
I will never leave you.

13:13.080 --> 13:14.800
My lord isn't coming back.

13:16.040 --> 13:18.120
Lord Xunfeng. General.

13:18.200 --> 13:19.320
Don't be so sad.

13:21.320 --> 13:22.680
Moon Supreme, wake up!

13:23.640 --> 13:24.560
- My lord.
- My lord.

13:35.360 --> 13:37.200
Dongfang Qingcang, wake up.

13:37.280 --> 13:38.360
Do you hear me?

13:53.960 --> 13:55.640
- My lord.
- My lord.

13:58.320 --> 13:59.440
Wake up.

14:01.240 --> 14:03.240
You must wake up, my lord!

14:43.560 --> 14:44.600
Big Blockhead.

14:45.160 --> 14:46.000
Don't go.

14:47.160 --> 14:48.040
Don't go.

14:50.400 --> 14:51.480
Look at me.

14:51.560 --> 14:53.040
I'm real.

14:55.040 --> 14:56.040
Touch me.

14:56.560 --> 14:57.880
Feel me.

14:58.720 --> 15:00.680
I'm real.

15:00.760 --> 15:02.400
I'm not a dream.

15:12.160 --> 15:14.080
Wake up!

15:15.360 --> 15:16.200
My lord!

15:16.280 --> 15:17.120
My lord!

15:23.720 --> 15:24.560
Moon Supreme!

15:24.640 --> 15:25.840
My lord!

15:25.920 --> 15:26.960
My lord!

15:27.040 --> 15:27.880
Moon Supreme!

15:27.960 --> 15:28.800
My lord!

15:28.880 --> 15:29.720
Shangque!

15:32.360 --> 15:33.560
- Shangque!
- Shangque!

15:33.640 --> 15:34.560
Calm down!

15:34.640 --> 15:35.560
Lord Xunfeng!

15:35.640 --> 15:37.040
- Moon Supreme!
- My lord!

15:52.320 --> 15:54.280
I knew from the beginning.

15:57.840 --> 15:59.040
You are not real.

16:02.280 --> 16:04.240
I also know this is just a dream.

16:09.400 --> 16:10.440
So

16:13.000 --> 16:14.000
I have to leave.

16:15.120 --> 16:16.080
Don't go.

16:18.520 --> 16:20.960
Please don't abandon me.

16:22.920 --> 16:24.880
We agreed

16:25.760 --> 16:28.360
that we would never be apart.

16:30.400 --> 16:32.640
We will be together forever.

16:51.120 --> 16:52.880
If you bring me back to life,

16:58.960 --> 17:00.800
I will marry someone else.

17:02.360 --> 17:05.319
Do you want to see me marry someone else?

17:12.079 --> 17:13.200
No, I don't.

17:20.839 --> 17:22.599
Don't go.

17:25.079 --> 17:27.359
I'm your wife.

17:29.360 --> 17:32.640
I want to be with you forever.

17:35.400 --> 17:37.520
Don't go.

17:40.280 --> 17:42.080
Don't go.

17:52.680 --> 17:53.720
Orchid.

17:56.960 --> 17:58.320
Wait for me.

18:01.880 --> 18:03.560
I will bring you back to life.

19:21.360 --> 19:22.440
Orchid.

19:37.680 --> 19:38.960
Ronghao.

19:40.520 --> 19:42.080
Are you afraid?

19:42.160 --> 19:43.240
Why are you here?

19:43.840 --> 19:44.840
This place

19:44.920 --> 19:46.680
was built when I was pure-minded.

19:46.760 --> 19:48.120
It's my true love for my master.

19:48.200 --> 19:49.400
You couldn't possibly get in.

19:50.320 --> 19:51.360
Is that so?

19:53.640 --> 19:54.560
Let me tell you.

19:55.160 --> 19:56.880
I did everything you asked me to do.

19:57.360 --> 19:58.440
From now on,

19:58.520 --> 20:00.080
don't bother me and my master again!

20:00.160 --> 20:02.480
You just need to answer me.

20:02.560 --> 20:05.240
Are you afraid?

20:06.320 --> 20:07.240
Afraid?

20:08.360 --> 20:09.600
What am I afraid of?

20:09.680 --> 20:11.880
Are you afraid
that she will learn the truth?

20:11.960 --> 20:14.360
But she will find out sooner or later.

20:14.440 --> 20:16.200
She will find out that her good disciple

20:16.280 --> 20:17.920
has committed atrocious deeds for her,

20:18.000 --> 20:20.760
sullying her with sin and filth

20:20.840 --> 20:23.480
that can never be cleansed.

20:27.160 --> 20:28.040
No.

20:29.240 --> 20:30.120
No!

20:32.480 --> 20:33.360
No!

20:37.680 --> 20:38.840
Master.

20:39.920 --> 20:41.040
Hao,

20:41.120 --> 20:42.800
did you have a nightmare again?

20:43.800 --> 20:45.600
I just dreamed that you were leaving me.

20:47.880 --> 20:49.200
You're talking like a child again.

20:50.360 --> 20:51.520
Go to sleep.

21:00.000 --> 21:01.120
What are you talking about?

21:01.880 --> 21:04.040
I'm the one who got Orchid killed.

21:04.120 --> 21:05.680
It was me.

21:05.760 --> 21:08.040
I took her to the Xuanxu Realm.

21:08.880 --> 21:11.160
I gave her the Chengying Sword.

21:11.240 --> 21:13.800
I watched her kill herself.

21:13.880 --> 21:15.240
What does it have to do with you?

21:16.760 --> 21:18.240
But Fairy Orchid

21:20.280 --> 21:22.920
clearly died
because of the Lord of Haishi.

21:23.000 --> 21:24.160
That's weird.

21:25.600 --> 21:27.320
I am the one drinking.

21:28.760 --> 21:30.000
Why are you drunk?

21:41.720 --> 21:42.880
Are you telling the truth?

21:43.360 --> 21:44.840
Why would I lie to you?

21:45.880 --> 21:48.080
She never stepped foot
outside of the Silent Moon Palace.

21:55.920 --> 21:57.960
Didn't Jieli take Fairy Orchid away?

21:59.640 --> 22:00.720
She tricked me.

22:03.560 --> 22:05.520
- But I--
- General, you mustn't drink.

22:06.480 --> 22:07.760
You just recovered from poison

22:07.840 --> 22:09.680
and to keep my lord alive,

22:09.760 --> 22:11.840
you have drained your primordial spirit.

22:12.400 --> 22:13.280
You mustn't drink.

22:13.360 --> 22:15.280
You should rest well.

22:15.360 --> 22:16.600
Poison?

22:18.320 --> 22:19.440
What poison?

22:19.520 --> 22:21.240
Don't you know, General?

22:21.320 --> 22:23.600
When I was treating you a few days ago,

22:24.160 --> 22:26.400
I found a scar from poison on your nape.

22:27.080 --> 22:29.160
Butterfly-Scale Poison is very lethal.

22:29.840 --> 22:31.360
Fortunately, it had been neutralized,

22:31.440 --> 22:33.520
so I didn't bring it up.

22:40.640 --> 22:41.480
Jieli.

22:41.560 --> 22:43.760
Where have you been?
What took you so long?

22:43.840 --> 22:44.760
It wasn't on purpose.

22:44.840 --> 22:45.880
I just--

22:52.920 --> 22:54.680
Why did you pull on my collar?

22:55.960 --> 22:57.560
She already knew.

23:01.720 --> 23:03.720
Did she detoxify my poison?

23:08.760 --> 23:09.960
Did she save me?

23:11.080 --> 23:12.120
Impossible.

23:14.720 --> 23:16.560
But she is from Haishi.

23:18.320 --> 23:19.680
When it comes to the Bone Orchid,

23:20.240 --> 23:21.680
she is the only one who could have.

23:27.920 --> 23:29.320
What was the reason?

23:53.640 --> 23:54.480
Hao,

23:55.440 --> 23:57.000
what are you hiding from me?

24:00.560 --> 24:01.720
Nothing.

24:02.640 --> 24:03.640
What's wrong?

24:03.720 --> 24:05.520
The music you used to play

24:06.040 --> 24:07.680
was the purest of the three realms.

24:07.760 --> 24:10.240
But now,
it has changed beyond recognition.

24:10.800 --> 24:12.280
What exactly have you been through?

24:14.320 --> 24:16.600
Maybe I have been worrying

24:16.680 --> 24:18.520
about your injuries these days.

24:19.320 --> 24:21.200
- So…
- Lies.

24:24.560 --> 24:25.480
Tell me.

24:25.960 --> 24:27.440
What are you hiding?

24:28.000 --> 24:29.080
I can't tell you.

24:29.640 --> 24:31.080
Please stop asking.

24:32.480 --> 24:34.680
Are you disobeying me now?

24:34.760 --> 24:36.160
I just don't want you

24:36.240 --> 24:38.120
to remember the pain you've forgotten.

24:39.520 --> 24:41.080
Master, didn't you say

24:41.160 --> 24:42.960
that you were tired
of the endless slaughtering

24:43.040 --> 24:44.680
and wanted to retire to the bamboo forest?

24:45.720 --> 24:47.360
Now I have realized it for you.

24:48.480 --> 24:49.360
From now on,

24:49.440 --> 24:51.280
we can live peacefully
in the bamboo forest.

24:51.360 --> 24:52.200
Isn't that good?

25:18.440 --> 25:19.600
What is this place?

25:20.520 --> 25:21.800
This is home.

25:21.880 --> 25:23.320
How could this happen?

25:30.280 --> 25:31.480
Master, do you know?

25:33.240 --> 25:34.440
One swing of the sword

25:36.520 --> 25:38.080
and 30,000 years have passed.

25:46.200 --> 25:47.440
Thirty thousand years?

25:48.240 --> 25:49.920
What happened?

25:57.400 --> 25:58.440
You betrayed me.

25:58.520 --> 26:01.040
- I'll kill you!
- You betrayed me!

26:01.640 --> 26:05.200
- Why are you doing this to me?
- I love you.

26:05.280 --> 26:06.720
Master.

26:06.800 --> 26:07.880
- You betrayed me!
- Master.

26:09.120 --> 26:10.000
Master.

26:11.080 --> 26:12.360
Master, don't listen.

26:12.440 --> 26:13.800
These are your painful memories

26:13.880 --> 26:15.120
from over a thousand lifetimes.

26:15.200 --> 26:16.680
I wanted you to forget,

26:16.760 --> 26:17.960
but when the illusion ends,

26:18.040 --> 26:18.880
they will resurface.

26:18.960 --> 26:19.800
Master, don't listen.

26:20.360 --> 26:21.760
Master.

26:51.760 --> 26:54.040
My bad disciple, Ronghao,
has committed a heinous crime.

26:54.120 --> 26:55.400
He is unforgivable.

26:56.040 --> 26:57.840
I failed to discipline him well.

26:57.920 --> 26:59.360
I should be punished as well.

27:01.040 --> 27:02.120
My lord,

27:02.200 --> 27:04.640
please send us
to the Immortal Slaying Pavilion

27:04.720 --> 27:06.120
to answer for Goddess of Xishan,

27:06.200 --> 27:07.880
the wrongfully massacred Xishan Tribe,

27:07.960 --> 27:09.600
and all living beings

27:09.680 --> 27:11.480
affected by the war in the three realms.

27:12.720 --> 27:15.040
All fault lies with me,

27:15.120 --> 27:16.320
not the former God of War.

27:16.400 --> 27:17.440
Silence.

27:18.000 --> 27:19.280
The goddess is dead.

27:19.960 --> 27:22.440
We cannot lose the God of War again.

27:23.000 --> 27:23.960
At present,

27:24.040 --> 27:26.040
the two tribes have stopped fighting,

27:26.120 --> 27:28.440
but the 100,000 enemy soldiers
have been freed.

27:29.000 --> 27:30.560
God of War, I hope

27:30.640 --> 27:32.440
you can prioritize our overall interests.

27:32.520 --> 27:35.440
You should resume your duties

27:35.920 --> 27:37.800
and continue to protect Shuiyuntian.

27:40.640 --> 27:41.720
God of War.

27:44.760 --> 27:45.720
Please rise.

28:01.640 --> 28:03.720
As for the immortal criminal Ronghao,

28:03.800 --> 28:05.760
take him to Karma Jail

28:05.840 --> 28:07.240
to await punishment.

28:47.520 --> 28:48.960
You can't die yet.

28:49.760 --> 28:50.880
You're useful again.

28:55.240 --> 28:57.040
As expected, you came.

28:58.880 --> 28:59.880
Where is my daughter?

28:59.960 --> 29:00.880
Didn't you ask me here

29:00.960 --> 29:02.880
to give me back my other daughter?

29:02.960 --> 29:04.680
Yes, but…

29:05.280 --> 29:06.640
I have one condition.

29:08.040 --> 29:09.720
I have let Ronghao go once

29:09.800 --> 29:10.920
and repaid his favor.

29:11.000 --> 29:12.560
We are even now.

29:13.560 --> 29:14.960
Give me back my daughter.

29:17.840 --> 29:19.200
How can such a large debt

29:20.080 --> 29:21.640
be written off so quickly?

29:22.440 --> 29:24.120
If you don't save my lord,

29:24.200 --> 29:25.400
I'm afraid

29:26.120 --> 29:28.000
you will never see your daughter again.

29:30.000 --> 29:31.760
As a high god of Shuiyuntian,

29:31.840 --> 29:34.040
how can I allow you
to continue controlling me?

29:34.120 --> 29:35.240
Today,

29:35.320 --> 29:36.760
I shall kill you.

29:36.840 --> 29:38.600
Only I can cure her poison.

29:39.840 --> 29:41.280
If you kill me,

29:41.880 --> 29:43.160
she won't live.

29:46.000 --> 29:47.920
Save my lord for me.

30:01.440 --> 30:02.760
Look.

30:02.840 --> 30:04.920
I gave her back to you alive.

30:05.880 --> 30:07.840
Her mother died for you.

30:08.320 --> 30:10.400
Do you also want to see your daughter die

30:10.480 --> 30:12.000
in front of you?

30:20.520 --> 30:21.400
Father.

30:23.360 --> 30:24.880
She is your daughter?

30:25.760 --> 30:27.440
Am I not your only daughter?

30:32.880 --> 30:34.200
So we are sisters.

30:34.280 --> 30:35.480
Don't touch me.

30:37.160 --> 30:38.520
No wonder I felt close to you

30:38.600 --> 30:40.040
when I saw you in Lucheng before.

30:41.000 --> 30:41.840
Father said

30:41.920 --> 30:43.560
that you're eight minutes older than me.

30:43.640 --> 30:44.640
You are my older sister.

30:47.560 --> 30:48.680
Father.

30:48.760 --> 30:49.680
Didn't you tell me

30:49.760 --> 30:51.280
that Mother was a mortal?

30:51.360 --> 30:53.080
This Moon Tribe woman is full of nonsense.

30:53.160 --> 30:55.440
Lock her up in Karma Jail.

30:56.240 --> 30:57.240
She…

31:03.360 --> 31:09.040
RUINS OF MYRIAD HEAVENS

31:09.120 --> 31:12.280
ARBITER HALL

31:12.360 --> 31:13.920
The Ruins of Myriad Heavens

31:16.120 --> 31:17.640
actually has an Arbiter Hall.

31:19.800 --> 31:21.680
Is Lady Arbiter really inside?

31:23.240 --> 31:24.680
A thousand years ago,

31:24.760 --> 31:26.920
Lady Arbiter released
the convicted dragon, Changyuan,

31:27.000 --> 31:28.640
fell in love, and married him.

31:28.720 --> 31:29.800
They violated heavenly laws.

31:31.080 --> 31:32.560
My brother exacted justice

31:32.640 --> 31:34.240
and imprisoned them here for eternity.

31:34.320 --> 31:36.200
Few people know this secret.

31:37.360 --> 31:38.680
Even Orchid thought

31:38.760 --> 31:40.680
her master was just fond
of the mundane world

31:40.760 --> 31:41.880
and traveling.

31:44.160 --> 31:46.000
And you kept it from her.

31:49.760 --> 31:52.200
The Ruins of Myriad Heavens
is the place of nirvana

31:52.280 --> 31:53.600
beyond the three realms.

31:53.680 --> 31:55.400
Living beings cannot leave after entering

31:55.480 --> 31:56.840
and have
only a galaxy of stars for company.

31:56.920 --> 31:58.080
Even I don't know

31:58.160 --> 31:59.920
if Lady Arbiter is still alive.

32:01.360 --> 32:02.640
I didn't tell Orchid

32:03.200 --> 32:04.640
because I didn't want her to be sad.

32:05.720 --> 32:06.800
If she doesn't know,

32:08.520 --> 32:09.920
then she can still have hope.

32:10.480 --> 32:12.480
Orchid once told me

32:13.200 --> 32:15.000
that her master had a Soul-Painting Brush

32:15.080 --> 32:17.280
that can draw anything in the three realms

32:17.360 --> 32:18.480
and turn it into reality.

32:18.960 --> 32:20.200
This Arbiter Hall

32:20.680 --> 32:22.200
must have been drawn by her.

32:22.840 --> 32:23.960
Drawn?

32:25.880 --> 32:28.920
Then were the fireflies that guided us

32:29.000 --> 32:30.440
and the boat that carried us

32:30.520 --> 32:31.840
also drawn by her?

32:33.880 --> 32:34.760
There was more.

32:35.400 --> 32:37.200
The flower cakes on the boat

32:39.040 --> 32:41.640
are the same as the ones

32:42.440 --> 32:43.600
that Orchid once made for me.

32:49.360 --> 32:50.520
She knows.

32:53.640 --> 32:55.080
She knows everything.

32:55.760 --> 32:56.600
It seems

32:57.280 --> 32:58.880
that Lady Arbiter knew you would come.

32:59.360 --> 33:01.800
The fireflies were a gift
that you gave to Orchid.

33:02.440 --> 33:04.000
Lady Arbiter also knew you would come.

33:08.680 --> 33:09.600
Let's go.

33:49.480 --> 33:50.360
There you are.

33:55.480 --> 33:57.440
Are you Lady Arbiter?

34:00.120 --> 34:03.760
CHANGYUAN

34:09.159 --> 34:10.199
Changyuan.

34:36.920 --> 34:38.159
LADY ARBITER

34:38.239 --> 34:39.520
Beat him up.

35:19.640 --> 35:21.000
You are the Moon Supreme.

35:21.920 --> 35:23.200
Why didn't you dodge?

35:23.800 --> 35:25.600
I am the one who wronged her.

35:26.440 --> 35:27.480
One hit is nothing.

35:28.440 --> 35:29.960
As long as she can be resurrected,

35:30.040 --> 35:31.720
what does it matter
if I must give up my life?

35:35.800 --> 35:37.560
The future is ever-changing.

35:38.080 --> 35:40.000
There is still a chance
in a desperate situation.

35:40.560 --> 35:41.880
If you know this,

35:42.360 --> 35:45.320
Orchid has a chance to be resurrected.

35:48.280 --> 35:49.640
Please enlighten me.

35:50.720 --> 35:51.800
This chance

35:52.480 --> 35:54.560
had been planted

35:54.640 --> 35:55.720
when you two first met.

35:58.200 --> 35:59.240
The first time

36:00.160 --> 36:01.600
we met?

36:17.920 --> 36:19.440
At the Haotian Tower,

36:20.240 --> 36:22.280
she used her goddess power

36:22.360 --> 36:23.720
to gather your primordial spirit.

36:29.600 --> 36:31.280
So she has been saving me

36:31.880 --> 36:33.120
since we first met.

36:35.240 --> 36:36.920
And I have been hurting her.

36:39.440 --> 36:40.720
What is the use

36:41.440 --> 36:42.400
in saying this now?

36:44.360 --> 36:45.360
Fortunately,

36:45.920 --> 36:47.360
a wisp of Orchid's primordial spirit

36:48.000 --> 36:49.480
is merged with your primordial spirit.

36:50.320 --> 36:51.640
To resurrect her,

36:52.320 --> 36:54.600
we need to remove her primordial spirit,

36:54.680 --> 36:56.920
nurture it in the Holy Land of Xilan,

36:57.000 --> 36:58.160
and wait for her to take form.

37:00.480 --> 37:01.560
All right.

37:03.280 --> 37:04.160
Go.

37:05.720 --> 37:06.720
One more thing.

37:07.240 --> 37:08.840
Please enlighten me.

37:12.320 --> 37:13.840
Go ahead.

37:13.920 --> 37:15.960
Dongfang Qingcang and Fairy Danyin

37:16.040 --> 37:17.480
both looked into the Tianji Mirror.

37:20.000 --> 37:21.520
They both saw

37:22.400 --> 37:23.560
Orchid and I getting married

37:23.640 --> 37:25.240
along the Oblivion River.

37:25.800 --> 37:27.400
I've tried so many times,

37:27.480 --> 37:28.680
but I've never seen it.

37:28.760 --> 37:30.680
There is nothing in the Tianji Mirror.

37:30.760 --> 37:32.440
Everything shown in the mirror

37:32.520 --> 37:33.560
is a prophecy.

37:34.280 --> 37:35.880
Those who can see this prophecy

37:35.960 --> 37:37.080
are the ones

37:37.160 --> 37:38.960
who can bring about this marriage.

37:40.840 --> 37:42.280
Is the future in the Tianji Mirror

37:42.360 --> 37:43.680
truly unalterable?

37:47.840 --> 37:48.760
Yes.

37:50.040 --> 37:51.240
It cannot be altered.

37:55.360 --> 37:56.480
Changheng,

37:57.440 --> 37:59.320
the next time you come,

37:59.400 --> 38:00.880
remember to bring plenty of fine wine.

38:06.760 --> 38:08.160
Thank you, Lady Arbiter.

38:13.840 --> 38:14.960
You.

38:18.320 --> 38:19.240
Come here.

38:40.000 --> 38:41.080
Take this.

38:47.800 --> 38:48.720
A Destiny Book.

38:48.800 --> 38:50.320
This is Orchid's Destiny Book.

38:53.040 --> 38:54.720
Don't be silly.

38:54.800 --> 38:56.240
You're not ordinary in the least.

38:57.160 --> 39:01.280
Even if I place you among 100,000 orchids,

39:01.840 --> 39:03.960
I can find you

39:04.040 --> 39:06.000
in an instant.
